# macOS AppleDouble stubs. This repo lives on the exFAT Lexar volume, which
# cannot store resource forks, so macOS writes a ._<name> sidecar next to every
# file it copies. 406 of them showed up as untracked here, and 122 landed inside
# .git/ where one shadowed the pack index and broke every git command with
# 'non-monotonic index'. Set COPYFILE_DISABLE=1 to stop them being created.
._*
app/local-workspace/.raimosa/
*.tgz
dist-release/
native/macos/build/
vendor/node/
dist-store/
